<title>ITALY: Italian M2 rose avge 4.1 pct in qtr end-Jan.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 rose avge 4.1 pct in qtr end-Jan.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 rose an adjusted average 4.1 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-Janaury compared with an average growth of 2.8 percent in the three months to end-December, the Bank of Italy said in a statement.  </p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
